{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103931","id":2383261812,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ODbB0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103931","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103931.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103931.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103931","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103931/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103931/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103931/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1bce92279f1cdedbcd54c1b0e5821584c86b8bbf","number":103931,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add single-reference constructor to `Span`, creating a `Span` of length 1.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"One more constructor!\r\n\r\nThis one can create a `Span` from a single element by l-value reference. Given\r\n```c++\r\nvoid function_taking_span(const Span<int> span) {\r\n    // [...]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou can call it like:\r\n```c++\r\nvoid main() {\r\n    function_taking_span(5);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt's analogous to the existing `VectorView` constructor with the same semantics:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/30bb49ec1ff3b3fc463074b8d28bc97d4db50b9f/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h#L72-L75\r\n\r\n## Discussion\r\n\r\nAn alternative to the constructor proposed here would be to just use https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103920:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nvoid main() {\r\n    function_taking_span({ 5 });\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt's a bits less convenient. Arguably, it's clearer as to what's happening, but at the same time, it's already pretty clear what's happening when passing a single value. \r\n\r\nI'm not sure where I stand myself. Let's hear if anybody's got opinions on this one!","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","g